    ("Chat concurrency", "How many chats one agent may hold.", "A concurrency of three is three waits. Do not staff it like three phone calls blindly, and do not staff it like one."),
    ("Omnichannel confusion", "One agent, many channels, one presence.", "A voice call should change chat availability if you said it would. Confirm the setting."),
    ("Presence sync", "The desktop state matching the phone state.", "When they diverge, the router and the human disagree. That is the bug."),
    ("SSO for the desktop", "Corporate identity for the agent login.", "An identity outage looks like a contact-center outage. Phones may still be up."),
    ("Wallboard", "A screen of queue numbers.", "It is only as live as the feed. A frozen wallboard starts a false bridge."),
    ("Threshold alert", "A warning when wait or queue size crosses a line.", "The line should match the promise you make to callers. A random line trains people to ignore it."),
    ("Contact id", "The platform's identifier for one interaction.", "Put it in the ticket. A timestamp plus a name is weaker."),
    ("Recording id", "The identifier of the media file.", "It should join to the contact id. If it does not, say so in the evidence pack."),
